=== 1. Extract the shared sites unrelated to composition ===
  Shared sites in Q1 and Q2 together: 136
  Sign concordance: 0.346 (47 / 136)
  Median |r| with the neutrophil fraction: shared sites 0.031, all 0.101
  Genes involved: 120
  First 40: ARHGAP22, ARHGAP24, ARHGEF10L, BAT1, BCL11A, BIK, BLNK, BRD9, C12orf61, C16orf52, C16orf88, C1orf21, C2CD2, CAMTA1, CAPZB, CC2D1B, CCDC138, CEP78, CHKB, CHKB-CPT1B, CMIP, CNBP, DAXX, DDB2, DDR1, DEK, DYNLRB2, EPB49, FCER2, FKBP5, FLOT1, FLRT2, FNIP2, FNTB, FOXK1, FOXK2, GABARAP, GALNT9, GCLC, GLOD4
